\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1.\cf0  Our master Jesus' way of life
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 is what we must all emulate
\par His disciples saw His glory
\par through His mighty wondrous works.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. The flesh that he took on alway
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 was covering of your glory
\par and it seemed like a living tent
\par within which He lived amongst men.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Jehovah's spirit was in him
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 which is His wisdom and knowledge
\par good advice and bravery he displased
\par and the love of God He gave us.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. His father brought him to this world
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 to be our knowledge, righteousness
\par sanctifier, our rescuer
\par and a special good saviour.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5. He preached goodnews to the suffering
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 the sick received his healing too
\par  the blind also received their sight
\par \pard\li225\sl200\slmult0  and the deaf were able to hear.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl200\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 6\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  6.  Of sinners also came to him
\par \pard\li225\sl200\slmult0\qj  and he taught them how to forgive
\par  He set free all those in slavery
\par  preached freedom to those in bondage.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li270\sl200\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 7\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 7. By so doing, he got learners
\par \pard\li270\sl200\slmult0 and friends and followers too
\par and he had a great flock of sheep
\par He died for them and they had life.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li270\sl200\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 8\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 8. And for his other sheep also
\par \pard\li270\sl200\slmult0 He still goes after them to-day
\par He says he shall still rake in more
\par and his flock shall truly increase.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li270\sl200\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 9\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 9. O! Jesus receive thanks and praise
\par \pard\li270\sl200\slmult0 for coming to look for people
\par \pard      and granted us your children
\par      \cf1 to receive life in him evermore.
\par \cf0 
\par \pard\fi-315\li360\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 10\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  10. The very thoughts in you displayed
\par \pard\li360\sl190\slmult0 to also be in us as well
\par \pard\li270\sl190\slmult0   and let us not dwell in this world
\par  as  shinning lamps of this dark world.
\par \pard\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2 
\par }

